# public/data/, layers.generated.ts and beats.generated.ts ARE committed, deliberately.
#
# They are generated by scripts/export_web.py from a 5.1 GB GeoPackage that lives outside
# this repo, and while the deck only ever ran on a machine that had that GeoPackage beside
# it, keeping them out was right — regenerate, don't commit.
#
# Publishing changed that. A build machine has no GeoPackage, so it cannot produce them:
# without the two .ts files the TypeScript build fails outright, and without public/data
# every layer 404s. They are build inputs now, not build outputs, and they are committed
# for the same reason a lockfile is. 94 MB, largest single file 17 MB.
